  Head: 'Hand-lining'
  Body:
  - 'A line, a weight and a hook. Let it down until you feel the bottom, then bring it up a foot so the hook rides clear.'
  - 'Fish take on the drop more often than the lift. Keep a finger on the line and you will feel it before you see it.'
